## Website Purpose

CzechAlert is your reliable partner in analytical and consulting activities. We focus on investigations, media monitoring, strategic intelligence, due diligence, and digital privacy protection for both businesses and individuals.

Core service areas:
- Intelligence & Security (OSINT, HUMINT, strategic threat assessments)
- PR & Media Monitoring (alerts, adverse media analysis, sentiment analysis, monthly reports from 180M+ sources)
- Holistic Background Checks (debts, addresses, aliases, usernames, social media, employment history)
- Business and Sales Intelligence (market entry, competitor analysis, sales strategy)
- Risk, Compliance & Due Diligence (evidence-based analysis for critical business decisions)
- Judicial & Personal Investigations (case preparation, evidence gathering, advisory)

